{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごっき〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐々木琴子です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"竜王祭に行きたい。゜(゜´Д｀゜)゜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"竜王祭の昼の部に行きたいよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"諦めたけどね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうチケットの抽選締め切りしちゃったけどね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ一応、一般販売っていうチャンスがあるんだよ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"諦めたのに諦めたのに..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抽選の時に応募だけしてハズれたら潔く諦めようと思ったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしも、もしも当たったら悲しくなるから応募しなかったけど一般販売ぃぃぃいいいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーーーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その日、もしも、もしも仕事が入って行けないとーって思って諦めてるんだけど当日券とかあるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち着きます落ち着きます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kotoko.sasaki/img/blog/kotoko.sasaki/img/2015/04/07/8008630/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グラビアザテレビジョンの中ページの衣装！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"裏表紙のも好きだけどこっちの衣装はもっと好き！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば最近、急に暖かくなったなぁって思う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもでもまだ寒い日もあるから油断しないようにしてるけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑いのと寒いのだったらどっちの方が好きだろうってしょっちゅう考えるけど毎回違う答えが出る気がするんだよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"因みに今は寒い方が好きだなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kotoko.sasaki/img/blog/kotoko.sasaki/img/2015/04/07/8008630/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都個握の時の！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"編み込みハーフアップしてるよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊告知＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・4/9(木)　ヤングジャンプ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーメンバー全員での撮影でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくつかのグループにわかれての撮影もあったんだけど、それがめっちゃ楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装も私は初めて着るような感じのだったかなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・4/15(水)　ノギメイト"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またノギメイトに出させていただきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通に楽しみながらの撮影でした！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"井上さんと松村さんと一緒に出ます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・4/17(金)　My Girl vol.3"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インタビューと撮影をしてきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月さんの表紙が目印です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"井上さんも中ページに載ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も中ページにソロで沢山載ります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い感じに撮りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふわふわしてて楽しかった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ノギカメラ　vol.42"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛と一緒に出ます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初ノギカメラです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひぜひ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヾ(*´∀｀*)ノ"}],"source":"archive"}